    "title": "Aztecs Volleyball's season comes to a close in Region I Semifinals at Glendale CC - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By 520 Sports Talk Staff ,\n1 days ago\n(Glendale, AZ) The Pima Community College volleyball team hit the road for its Region I, Division II Semifinals match on Wednesday at Glendale Community College (14-6). The No. 3 seeded Aztecs won the first set but dropped the next three games as they fell to the No. 2 Gauchos in four sets (22-25, 25-14, 25-13, 25-21).\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
